    <string name="whats_new_body">\u2022 Material 3 Expressive design\n\u2022 A Save file composer that shows the exact destination before saving\n\u2022 Share many files at once and pick which ones to save in one scrollable list\n\u2022 Pin your own folders so any folder is one tap away\n\u2022 Long-press the folder buttons to reorder them, built-in folders included\n\u2022 Bottom navigation: Save, Locations and About\n\u2022 The composer opens over the app you shared from, instead of switching apps\n\u2022 Save locations are remembered with file counts and last-used dates</string>
